<document xmlns="https://open.law/schemas/library" xmlns:codified="https://open.law/schemas/codified" xmlns:codify="https://open.law/schemas/codify" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude" id="Kiowa Tribe Res. No. KL-CY-2024-018">
  <num>KL-CY-2024-018</num>
  <heading>Repealing of Resolution KL-CY-2017-014 Employee Benefits Provider Selection Act of 2017.</heading>
  <meta>
    <effective>2024-09-24</effective>
    <history>
      <adopted>2024-09-14</adopted>
    </history>
    <citations>
      <citation type="res" url="./adopted/KL-CY-2024-018.pdf">Kiowa Tribe Res. No. KL-CY-2024-018</citation>
    </citations>
  </meta>
  <text>At a duly called Session of the Legislature of the Kiowa Tribe held this 14th day of September, the following Resolution and Law were adopted.</text>
  <recitals>
    <recital>
      <conjunction>WHEREAS;</conjunction>
      <text>	the Legislature is vested with the authority to pass laws and resolutions pursuant to <cite doc="Constitution of the Kiowa Tribe">Article VI, Section 6(a) of the Constitution of the Kiowa Tribe</cite>; and,</text>
    </recital>
    <recital>
      <conjunction>WHEREAS;</conjunction>
      <text><cite doc="Constitution of the Kiowa Tribe">the Kiowa Constitution, Article VI, Section 6(a)</cite> Laws and Resolutions which have been enacted shall remain valid until amended or repealed; and,</text>
    </recital>
    <recital>
      <conjunction>WHEREAS;</conjunction>
      <text> the Legislature shall repeal the enacted <cite doc="Kiowa Tribe Res. No. KL-CY-2017-014">Resolution KL-CY-2017-014</cite> Employee Provider Selection Act of 2017, due to the formation of Articles of Incorporation for Kiowa Insurance, Inc. A Kiowa Tribe Corporation enacted through <cite doc="Kiowa Tribe Res. No. KL-CY-2023-011">Resolution KL-CY-2023-011</cite> Kiowa Tribe Uniform Commercial Business Codes of 2023; and,</text>
    </recital>
    <recital>
      <conjunction>WHEREAS;</conjunction>
      <text> pursuant to Articles of Incorporation for "Kiowa Insurance Inc." is wholly owned by the Kiowa Tribe in accordance with Article 5 of <cite doc="Kiowa Tribe Res. No. KL-CY-2023-011">KL-CY-2023-011</cite> Kiowa Tribe Uniform Commercial Business Codes of 2023, Section 4.1, 1) to procure insurance and comprehensive employee benefit plans, including health and retirement, of all kinds for the Kiowa Tribe, including, but not limited to: the three branches of government and their respective employees; current and future property and business.</text>
    </recital>
    <recital>
      <conjunction>NOW THEREFORE IT BE IT RESOLVED;</conjunction>
      <text> that the Legislature hereby repeals <cite doc="Kiowa Tribe Res. No. KL-CY-2017-014">Resolution KL-CY-2017-014</cite> Employee Provider Selection Act of 2017.</text>
    </recital>
  </recitals>
